Fresh build is finally here!

What's new:
- Sounds and music are added. Finally you can HEAR new Pixel Fodder;
- Skills. From this moment you can upgrade your hero with cool perks;
- Graphics optimisation. Faster work, better performance. 

New build is available for PC and Mac users.

