[b]New big & RED is here![/b]
Couple of weeks i making new game menu for Pixel Fodder. Now it is ready for keyboard inputs. Still have some bugs with scroll menus but they will be fixed soon.

What else:
[list]
[*]Added gamepad support;
 [*]New FURY bodys for your heroes;
 [*]Added a couple guns and suits;
 [*]Campaign was moved to seasons;
 [*]Totally remade weapon system, now it is ready for easy modding;
 [*]Fixed couple of minor bug;
[/list]

